{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——我们想要好好学会交合，却最后不了了之。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": "——我们想要好好学会交合，却最后不了了之。", "plain_idx": 222, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以才说，我们是在“学习交合的过程中”。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "周一是令人扫兴的阴天。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……啊」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2731", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理不经意地发出了声音。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她慌慌张张地放下了嘴角边上的手指。", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了吗？」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0562", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么事都没有，什么事都没有」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2732", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘴角呀……嘿嘿嘿♪\\n　安洁知道啦」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": "「嘴角呀……嘿嘿嘿♪　安洁知道啦」", "plain_idx": 237, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0563", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你是在想昨天在路上的那件事吧，\\n　诶嘿嘿，毕竟是爱理同学嘛」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": "「你是在想昨天在路上的那件事吧，　诶嘿嘿，毕竟是爱理同学嘛」", "plain_idx": 240, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0564", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是啦，不是这样的」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2733", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你脸都红啦。\\n　我说～新吾同学～爱理同学可爱吧～」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": "「你脸都红啦。　我说～新吾同学～爱理同学可爱吧～」", "plain_idx": 245, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0565", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾同学把脸背过去啦！\\n　明明昨天还在安洁的面前秀恩爱来着」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": "「新吾同学把脸背过去啦！　明明昨天还在安洁的面前秀恩爱来着」", "plain_idx": 249, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0566", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不是的，爱理会把手放在嘴角边，\\n绝对不是因为安洁说的，昨天在路上的那个吻。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": "……不是的，爱理会把手放在嘴角边，绝对不是因为安洁说的，昨天在路上的那个吻。", "plain_idx": 252, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而是比接吻更甚——", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是我们想要学习交合的过程中的事情……", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总、总之！！」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2734", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们聊天还聊到一半呢。\\n　下周一就是期末考试了！」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": "「我们聊天还聊到一半呢。　下周一就是期末考试了！」", "plain_idx": 258, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2735", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜呜！怎么背过脸去说了这么讨厌的话！」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0567", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜呜呜爱理同学，爱理同学～\\n　帮帮我嘛，考试要来了」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": "「呜呜呜爱理同学，爱理同学～　帮帮我嘛，考试要来了」", "plain_idx": 263, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0568", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你要是有时间哭的话那就去学习。\\n　我之前就教过你怎么学习了吧？」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": "「你要是有时间哭的话那就去学习。　我之前就教过你怎么学习了吧？」", "plain_idx": 266, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2736", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要、要做的事情就要认真去做。\\n　你说对吧？新，新吾」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": "「要、要做的事情就要认真去做。　你说对吧？新，新吾」", "plain_idx": 269, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2737", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊……」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我对已经羞红了脸的爱理回应道。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管怎么说，考试也真的接近了。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉，还有考试……」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0195", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我还觉得现在还在学期的前中段呢～\\n　时间过的真快啊」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "「我还觉得现在还在学期的前中段呢～　时间过的真快啊」", "plain_idx": 279, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0228", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要说今天的天气是阴雨蒙蒙的话，那教室里的气氛就是乌云笼罩了。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说到考试，爱理还是很认真的。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「资料这下打印好了。\\n　接下来要做个计划表，（嘀咕嘀咕嘀咕）……」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": "「资料这下打印好了。　接下来要做个计划表，（嘀咕嘀咕嘀咕）……」", "plain_idx": 284, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2738", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理挺直腰板，为了给考试做好万全的准备，她快速进入了状态。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": "爱理挺直腰板，为了给考试做好万全的准备，她快速进入了状态。", "plain_idx": 286, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谢谢你陪我，新吾」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2739", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用，这种小事而已，我什么时候都有空的」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你可以再陪我一下吗？\\n　我得去买一下笔记本」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": "「你可以再陪我一下吗？　我得去买一下笔记本」", "plain_idx": 291, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2740", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……在结女的小卖部买会不会太贵？」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是我在学校用的。我在家用的都是传单的内面」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2741", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「回头再说吧……大概就是这么点事。走，我们出发吧」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2742", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，爱理。你又跟小新吾在一块呢」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0217", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我有在认真学习的！\\n　我还认真地制定了计划，绝对不会放松的！！」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": "「我有在认真学习的！　我还认真地制定了计划，绝对不会放松的！！」", "plain_idx": 303, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2743", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对着校长这么说完，\\n她一回到房间就换上了衣服，马上开始了学习。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": "对着校长这么说完，她一回到房间就换上了衣服，马上开始了学习。", "plain_idx": 306, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔…………」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2744", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，你要是有什么不明白的地方就要跟我说哦」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2745", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，谢谢」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即使是在跟我说话的时候，爱理也是目不转睛地看着手里的题。", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然我也在跟她一起学习……", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看着爱理一副心无旁骛的样子，\\n我不禁佩服，原来成绩在年级顶尖的人就是这样子的啊。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": "看着爱理一副心无旁骛的样子，我不禁佩服，原来成绩在年级顶尖的人就是这样子的啊。", "plain_idx": 315, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……唔……好好想想爱理，好好想想，\\n　可不能在这种题上花时间啊，唔唔唔唔……」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": "「唔……唔……好好想想爱理，好好想想，　可不能在这种题上花时间啊，唔唔唔唔……」", "plain_idx": 317, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2746", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「！」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2747", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「搞定……下一题……\\n　还有20页，20页……！」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": "「搞定……下一题……　还有20页，20页……！」", "plain_idx": 322, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2748", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——不是，这股气魄怎么有种令人毛骨悚然的感觉，\\n不知道刚刚的形容会不会对爱理来说有些过头。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": "——不是，这股气魄怎么有种令人毛骨悚然的感觉，不知道刚刚的形容会不会对爱理来说有些过头。", "plain_idx": 325, "len": 46, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理为了解决事先做好的学习指标，\\n以一种极强的气势移动着自动铅笔。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": "爱理为了解决事先做好的学习指标，以一种极强的气势移动着自动铅笔。", "plain_idx": 327, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
