{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天的指标做完了！！」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2749", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在时间刚刚抵达十点时，\\n爱理像是越过终点线一样放下了手中的自动铅笔。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": "在时间刚刚抵达十点时，爱理像是越过终点线一样放下了手中的自动铅笔。", "plain_idx": 332, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2750", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好猛的冲劲……」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和我完成的量厚度完全不一样。\\n当然这两份题目的难度也肯定是天差地别的吧。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": "和我完成的量厚度完全不一样。当然这两份题目的难度也肯定是天差地别的吧。", "plain_idx": 337, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟都已经决定了，今晚到10点就都要写完嘛」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2751", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要做的事情就要认真去做。\\n　我早上也向安洁这么说了吧」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": "「要做的事情就要认真去做。　我早上也向安洁这么说了吧」", "plain_idx": 341, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2752", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾做完了吗？」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2753", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，多亏了你我也做完了。\\n　……虽说跟爱理的不是一个级别的」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": "「嗯，多亏了你我也做完了。　……虽说跟爱理的不是一个级别的」", "plain_idx": 346, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为我跟你的目标排名不一样嘛。\\n　只要是你决定好时间，集中精力完成了的话，那我就很满意啦」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": "「因为我跟你的目标排名不一样嘛。　只要是你决定好时间，集中精力完成了的话，那我就很满意啦」", "plain_idx": 348, "len": 47, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2754", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说来，有件事……」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2755", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理轻轻地，往我身旁跪坐了下来。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的脸一眨眼就红了，拳头放在嘴角边，扭扭捏捏地。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
